  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Spiked Club\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1H_spiked_club.png\" title=\"Spiked Club\"><img alt=\"Spiked Club\" border=\"0\" src=\"/images/recovered/1H_spiked_club.png\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Damage Type:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Crushing\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Wielding:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">One-Handed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Attack Speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Fast\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client weapon speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">125\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client damage coeff:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">0.66\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Spiked Club</b> is listed on the <a href=\"/wiki/Category/One-Handed-fighter\" title=\"Category:One-Handed-fighter\">One-Handed-fighter</a> weapon list. Stats on this page come from the old weapon lists.</p>\n<p>This weapon also exists in other materials (Cardboard Spiked Club, Celestial Spiked Club, Default Spiked Club, Diamond Spiked Club, Iron Spiked Club, Obsidian Spiked Club, Stone Spiked Club, Tin Spiked Club, …).</p>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
